error BYN3002: `ys` does not live as long as `kept`, which borrows it

   2 │     xs.replace(at: 0..0, by: ys)
     │                              -- `keep` stores `ys` into `xs` here
     │
  11 │         keep(ys, to: ref kept)
     │         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `ys` is freed at the end of its block
     │
  help: copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
